# --- VCR cassettes (recorded model responses) ---
# NOT committed, deliberately. They contain no credentials (langsmith's VCR
# config strips every request header before recording), but:
#   1. this is a public repo, and responses carry workspace-identifying headers
#      (e.g. Anthropic-Organization-Id) and internal gateway URLs;
#   2. cassette filenames are keyed on the LangSmith *dataset UUID*, so a
#      cassette recorded in one workspace never replays in another anyway.
# Each user records their own on first run. See module_4_ci/README.md.
fixtures/cassettes/

